# .secretallow — allowlist for secret-scanner.py
#
# Each line is either:
#   1. A fingerprint:  path/to/file.ts:42
#      Match is allowed at that exact file:line.
#   2. A regex:        /your-pattern-here/
#      Match content matching the regex is allowed anywhere.
#   3. A comment:      # starts with hash
#
# Use sparingly. Adding to allowlist does NOT rotate a leaked secret —
# rotate first, then suppress noise.

# Example: project-wide test keys that look like real ones
# /sk-test-1234567890abcdef/

# Example: documented placeholder in README
# README.md:12
